  title: 'Revised Curriculum (2000s) '
  info: "The education system evolved to prioritize holistic development, emphasizing
    creativity, critical thinking, and character-building. Initiatives like \u201CTeach
    Less, Learn More\u201D encouraged schools to focus on quality rather than quantity
    in teaching. Co-curricular activities (CCAs) gained importance as part of student
    development.  "
